The optional evaluation runtime downloads upstream code and model checkpoints;
they are not vendored in this repository. Preserve upstream notices and licenses.

ESAM: https://github.com/xuxw98/ESAM
FastSAM: https://github.com/CASIA-IVA-Lab/FastSAM
FastSAM and its Ultralytics components include AGPL-3.0 code. Deployment and
distribution must follow those terms or applicable commercial licensing.
MinkowskiEngine: https://github.com/NVIDIA/MinkowskiEngine
NVTX: https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVTX

models.json records the exact source revisions and downloaded checkpoint hashes.
Reported upstream benchmark results are not measurements of this deployment.
